gnition, and model fusion extend what the agent can call."},"129":{"id":"/docs/architecture-127","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#21-system-positioning-and-value","content":"Around these core capabilities sit presentation features (footer status bar, ask-user prompts, keyboard chords, notifications) and team-process features (workflow commands with sandboxes, milestones, a kanban web UI)."},"130":{"id":"/docs/architecture-128","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#22-user-roles-and-scenarios","content":"User role"},"131":{"id":"/docs/architecture-129","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#22-user-roles-and-scenarios","content":"Description"},"132":{"id":"/docs/architecture-130","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#22-user-roles-and-scenarios","content":"Primary scenarios"},"133":{"id":"/docs/architecture-131","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#22-user-roles-and-scenarios","content":"**AI coding agent users**"},"134":{"id":"/docs/architecture-132","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#22-user-roles-and-scenarios","content":"Developers running Pi in a terminal with Unipi installed"},"135":{"id":"/docs/architecture-133","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#22-user-roles-and-scenarios","content":"Run long sessions without hitting context limits; delegate sub-tasks to helpers; recall prior sessions; call MCP tools; receive mobile notifications when input is needed"},"136":{"id":"/docs/architecture-134","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#22-user-roles-and-scenarios","content":"**Extension developers**"},"137":{"id":"/docs/architecture-135","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#22