adius of most changes is one package."},"2918":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain-294","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain#7-design-principles-observed","content":"**Fail-soft by default.** `emitEvent`, `readModelCache`, `writeModelCache`, `loadConfig`, `readLastCheck`, `getPiVersion`, cleanup and diagnostics all catch and degrade rather than throw. The updater swallows check failures entirely."},"2919":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain-295","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain#7-design-principles-observed","content":"**Security hygiene built into primitives.** Bounded-output artifacts enforce private directory/file modes and refuse symlinked or shared directories; the bundle build refuses to ship on secret-pattern matches; the prefix tracker keeps only keyed HMACs with an ephemeral key; analytics metadata is sanitised."},"2920":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain-296","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain#7-design-principles-observed","content":"**Startup and render performance as constraints.** Prebuilt bundle (\\~1 s → \\~80 ms), no-subprocess `getPiVersion`, width-keyed render caches, `unref`'d timers, and call-time sandbox enforcement that preserves the provider prefix cache."},"2921":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain-297","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain#7-design-principles-observed","content":"**Context window as the scarcest resource.** `boundModelOutput` and `MCP_DEFAULTS.MAX_MODEL_OUTPUT_BYTES` (both 64 KiB) enforce a consistent ceiling on what tools may return to the model."},"2922":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain-298","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain#8-known-issues-and-recommendations","content":"Priority"},"2923":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain-299","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain#8-known-issues-and-recommendations","content":"Item"},"2924":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain-300","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain#8-known-issues-and-recommendations","content":"High"},"2925":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain-301","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain#8-known-issues-and-recommendations","content":"Reconcile `core/constants.ts#MODULES` with the real workspace: remove `REGISTRY`, `TASK`, `IMPECCABLE`, `SETTINGS`; add `BACKGROUND_TASKS`, `FUSION`, `TRAJECTORY`, `COMMAND_ENCHANTMENT`. The updater README browser inherits the stale map."},"2926":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain-302","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/platform-core-and-shared-infrastructure-domain","tags":[],"type":"t