 a settings TUI for toggling groups, segments, presets, separators, icons and colour mode."},"3461":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-93","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#23-data-model","content":"`src/types.ts` defines the contracts every segment adheres to:"},"3462":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-94","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#23-data-model","content":"**`FooterSegment`** — `{ id, label, shortLabel, description, zone: \"left\" | \"center\" | \"right\", render: SegmentRenderFn, defaultShow }`."},"3463":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-95","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#23-data-model","content":"**`FooterGroup`** — `{ id, name, segments: FooterSegment[], defaultShow }`; typically one group per upstream package."},"3464":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-96","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#23-data-model","content":"**`FooterSegmentContext`** — passed to each `render()`: `theme`, `colors` (a `ColorScheme` of semantic names such as `model`, `gitDirty`, `tpsBlazing`, `contextWarn`), `data` (cached group data from the registry), `width`, `piContext`, `footerData`, `labelMode`."},"3465":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-97","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#23-data-model","content":"**`RenderedSegment`** — `{ content, visible }`. Segments hide themselves rather than showing placeholder dashes; the MCP segments explicitly document \"Never shows `—`\"."},"3466":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-98","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#23-data-model","content":"**`PresetDef`** — ordered `leftSegments`, `rightSegments`, `secondarySegments`, optional `colors` and `zoneSeparator`."},"3467":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-99","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#23-data-model","content":"**`FooterSettings`** — `enabled`, `preset`, `glanceMode`, `separator`, `iconStyle`, `zoneSeparator`, `showFullLabels`, `colorMode`, and per-group `groups[id] = { show, segments: {...} }`."},"3468":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-100","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#23-data-model","content":"`index.ts` declares the canonical group list:"},"3469":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-101","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#24-footerregistry--the-reactive-data-cache","content":"`FooterRegistry` is a process-wide singleton (`getFooterRegistry()`) with three concerns:"},"3470":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-102","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presenta