ype":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#25-event-wiring","content":"all"},"3507":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-139","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#25-event-wiring","content":"`invalidateAll()` — newly loaded modules may bring fresh data"},"3508":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-140","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#25-event-wiring","content":"Segment renderers read from more than the registry. `segments/mcp.ts` resolves stats in priority order: `globalThis.__unipi_mcp_stats` (direct from the MCP registry if published) → `ctx.data` aggregate fields. `segments/core.ts` derives token/cost totals by walking `piContext.sessionManager.getBranch()` and summing `usage` on non-errored assistant messages. `segments/status-ext.ts` renders `footerData.getExtensionStatuses()` entries, stripping the emoji prefixes packages set on their own statuses and substituting icons from the configured icon style."},"3509":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-141","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#26-footerrenderer--layout-algorithm","content":"`FooterRenderer.computeLayout(width)` implements a zone-based responsive layout with progressive degradation:"},"3510":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-142","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#26-footerrenderer--layout-algorithm","content":"Notable properties:"},"3511":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-143","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#26-footerrenderer--layout-algorithm","content":"**Cache discipline.** Results are memoised by width for up to 5 seconds; any registry update marks the layout dirty via the renderer's subscription. `scheduleRender()` debounces dirtying at `RENDER_DEBOUNCE_MS = 33`."},"3512":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-144","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#26-footerrenderer--layout-algorithm","content":"**Explicit-enable override.** A segment the user turned on in the settings TUI appears even if the active preset omits it (`isSegmentExplicitlyEnabled`)."},"3513":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-145","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#26-footerrenderer--layout-algorithm","content":"**Width safety.** Every row passes through `truncateToWidth`; the `footer-top` widget further caps output at `width − 1`. The code cites issue #31: a line at *exactly* terminal width trips auto-wrap on some terminals and desynchronises pi-tui's differential renderer."},"3514":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-146","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#26-footerrenderer--layout-algorithm","content":"**Zone separator** defaults to `│` (dimmed) and can be disabled with `\"none\"`."},"3515":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-147","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#27-lifecycle-and-ui-slots","content":"`footerExtension(pi)` registers streaming hooks once at factory time (because `pi.on` has no unsubscribe) and does per-session setup on `session_start`:"},"3516":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-148","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#27-lifecycle-and-ui-slots","content":"Load settings; set preset, active flag, `glanceMode` (default **on**)."},"3517":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-149","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#27-lifecycle-and-ui-slots","content":"If enabled and `ctx.hasUI`, call `subscribeToEvents`."},"3518":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-150","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#27-lifecycle-and-ui-slots","content":"Defer `installGlanceEditor` by 3.5 seconds — a focus-safety grace period for the boot dashboard and updater prompt; after `setEditorComponent`, any previously focused overlay is re-focused so `q`/Esc are never stranded."},"3519":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-151","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#27-lifecycle-and-ui-slots","content":"Reset the TPS tracker, sync the streaming cursor (`cursorSyncCount`) to the number of persisted assistant messages, and call `setupFooterUI`."},"3520":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-152","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#27-lifecycle-and-ui-slots","content":"`setupFooterUI` installs three Pi UI slots:"},"3521":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-153","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#27-lifecycle-and-ui-slots","content":"Slot"},"3522":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-154","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#27-lifecycle-and-ui-slots","content":"Placement"},"3523":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-155","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#27-lifecycle-and-ui-slots","content":"Content (classic mode)"},"3524":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-156","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#27-lifecycle-and-ui-slots","content":"Content (glance mode)"},"3525":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-157","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#27-lifecycle-and-ui-slots","content":"`ctx.ui.setFooter(...)`"},"3526":{"id":"/docs/