apshot:"},"3601":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-233","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#43-undo-snapshot-strategy","content":"**Pause** — 500 ms since the last keypress (`SNAPSHOT_PAUSE_MS`)."},"3602":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-234","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#43-undo-snapshot-strategy","content":"**Count** — 20 edit keys since the last snapshot (`SNAPSHOT_COUNT_THRESHOLD`)."},"3603":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-235","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#43-undo-snapshot-strategy","content":"**Time** — 3 s since the last snapshot even while typing (`SNAPSHOT_TIME_MS`)."},"3604":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-236","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#43-undo-snapshot-strategy","content":"`UndoRedoBuffer` (`undo-redo.ts`) keeps at most `MAX_UNDO_SNAPSHOTS = 50`, applies a `UNDO_DEBOUNCE_MS = 500` guard on `snapshot()`, and clears the redo stack on every new snapshot. Both stacks are cleared on `session_shutdown`. Opening the chord overlay suppresses the listener so the ALT+S keypress itself does not create a snapshot that would later \"undo the undo\"."},"3605":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-237","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#44-registers","content":"`RegisterStore` (`registers.ts`) persists ten numbered registers plus the stash to `.unipi/config/input-shortcuts.json`, lazily loaded on first access and written atomically (`.tmp` + `renameSync`). Persistence failures are silent — registers are best-effort."},"3606":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-238","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#45-integration-points","content":"`pi.registerShortcut(Key.alt(\"s\"))` and `Key.alt(\"i\")`; overlay options `width: 42, maxHeight: 20, anchor: \"top-center\"`."},"3607":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-239","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#45-integration-points","content":"Registers an **info-screen group** (`id: \"input-shortcuts\"`, priority 115) through `globalThis.__unipi_info_registry` exposing chord key, tab key, registers used and stash status."},"3608":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-240","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#45-integration-points","content":"Emits `MODULE_READY { name: MODULES.INPUT_SHORTCUTS, commands: [\"unipi:stash-settings\"] }` at load time (not on `session_start`)."},"3609":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-241","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#51-responsibilities","content":"Translates Pi lifecycle events and Unipi feature events into out-of-band alerts on native desktop, ntfy, Gotify and Telegram, with priority mapping, optional LLM recap, keyboard-activity suppression, and reminder re-notification for human-blocking prompts. It also exposes the `notify_user` tool so the agent can send ad-hoc messages."},"3610":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-242","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#53-event-subscription-model","content":"`events.ts#BUILTIN_EVENTS` is a table mapping notify event keys to Pi hooks / core events and display labels:"},"3611":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-243","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#53-event-subscription-model","content":"Event key"},"3612":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-244","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#53-event-subscription-model","content":"Hook"},"3613":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-245","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#53-event-subscription-model","content":"Label"},"3614":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-246","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain#53-event-subscription-model","content":"Listener API"},"3615":{"id":"/docs/deep-exploration/user-interaction-and-presentation-domain-247","page_id":"/docs/deep-exploration/us